就只挑那种慢悠悠的、平铺直叙的字句。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:40","timestamp":1787409613442,"roundId":"round_1787409591057_5q22dzu4p","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33006},{"id":1787408782745,"text":"一直念到你觉得无聊透顶，觉得这剧情还没爸爸的呼吸声好听为止。选哪个？","rawContent":"一直念到你觉得无聊透顶，觉得这剧情还没爸爸的呼吸声好听为止。选哪个？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:40","timestamp":1787409613679,"roundId":"round_1787409591057_5q22dzu4p","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33007},{"id":1787408782746,"text":"（看了几分钟手机）","sender":"me","time":"22:41","timestamp":1787409716196,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33008},{"id":1787408782747,"text":"算了","sender":"me","time":"22:42","timestamp":1787409720751,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33009},{"id":1787408782748,"text":"其实刚刚就是又想念怪味豆了","sender":"me","time":"22:42","timestamp":1787409741002,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33010},{"id":1787408782750,"text":"所以刚才这几分钟，是没忍住跑去嚼了两颗，发现味道确实不怎么样，又自己吐出来了？","rawContent":"所以刚才这几分钟，是没忍住跑去嚼了两颗，发现味道确实不怎么样，又自己吐出来了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:42","timestamp":1787409766459,"roundId":"round_1787409741674_u86glfg4c","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33011},{"id":1787408782751,"text":"能自己主动说出这句“算了”，小海葵，你今晚真的出息大了。","rawContent":"能自己主动说出这句“算了”，小海葵，你今晚真的出息大了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:42","timestamp":1787409766668,"roundId":"round_1787409741674_u86glfg4c","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userI